# @last-edited: 2026-11-08 UTC+7.
# @title: .assetsignore - keep the repository own files out of the site upload.
# @state: one list of what the Cloudflare upload must not carry; tests/landing/landing-hosting.test.mjs fails on drift.
# @dependencies: none stated.

# WHY this file exists: Cloudflare Pages uploads the whole directory, so the repository own files would travel with the site.
# Same exclusions, same order.

.vercel
.env*
AGENTS.md
.gitignore
.assetsignore
